    "instrument": "Native Binance USD-M perpetual4h official monthly ZIP/CHECKSUM pairs; not synthetic shorts on spot prices.",
    "entry": "Close above previous55 completed4h highs and EMA200=>BUY; below previous55 lows and EMA200=>SELL. Next4h open.200bar warmup. Each stage starts flat using earlier bars for indicators only.",
    "exit": "Initial2WilderATR14 stop; previous20bar opposite channel;3ATR favorable-close trail applied only next bar. No fixed target, early breakeven or arbitrary12bar stop. Adverse gap stops fill at actual open. Opposite entry only after prior position exit; no samebar reentry.",
    "costs": "10bp roundtrip fee+2spread+4slippage, plus adverse3bp per commenced8h holding interval, with all components multiplied1.5 for stress. No favorable funding credit or observed-fill claim.",
    "gates": {
      "minimumPooledClosed": 50,
      "minimumEachDirectionClosed": 15,
      "minimumEachAssetClosed": 15,
      "netPF": 1.2,
      "positiveStress": true,
      "positiveEachAsset": true,
      "positiveEachDirection": true
    },
    "gating": "Acquire validation only if entire fixed development passes. No choosing a favorable direction or asset after results. All per-direction/per-asset metrics retained; no release authority. Historical dates written before acquisition; no project-wide untouched claim.",
    "context": "One new prospective adaptation after pooled long/short model failed its direction gate. No sweep. Prior rules and failed evidence preserved. Baseline parity is verified against every original development trade before filtered evaluation.",
    "publication": false,
    "execution": false,
    "promotion": false,
    "filter": "In addition to original entry, BUY requires EMA50>EMA200 and EMA200 above its value6 completed4h bars ago. SELL requires EMA50<EMA200 and EMA200 below its value6bars ago. Symmetric filter, no other entry/exit/cost/gate changes."
  },
